Coverage limits

The standard policy covers up to ₹10 lakh per bike, which is more than sufficient for the market value of most motorcycles. The coverage includes all third‑party liabilities that may arise from damage caused to other vessels or cargo. The insurer also offers optional add‑ons such as “Full Replacement” and “Extended Liability” for an additional premium. The policy is valid for the entire duration of the shipping schedule, from loading at the Chennai port to unloading at the Kolkata port.

Claim process

