4. Once verified, the insurer releases the claim amount directly to the owner or the corporate bank account.

100 % Covered Guarantee

The “100 % Covered Guarantee” is a value‑added feature that eliminates any deductible. In case of a claim, the insurer pays the full insured amount without any out‑of‑pocket expense for the policyholder. This guarantee is particularly useful for corporate fleets where the company wants to ensure that the entire cost of loss is recovered.

RC requirements and corporate reimbursement

