<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Chennai to Kolkata | Safe Two-Wheeler Shipping
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I track my bike parcel during the Chennai to Kolkata train segment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad provides a live GPS tracking portal that updates you at every major checkpoint. Once the bike is loaded onto the freight train, you receive a unique tracking ID. Enter this ID on our tracking page to view real‑time location, estimated arrival, and any transit alerts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the original registration certificate (RC) required for shipping my bike by train?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, the original RC is mandatory for train‑based bike parcels as per Indian Railways regulations. It verifies ownership and ensures smooth clearance at both origin and destination stations. Our team assists in preparing the RC copy and guides you on secure handling during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad the best bike parcel service in Tenkasi for long‑distance moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our Tenkasi service combines ISO‑9001:2015 quality management, a dedicated fleet of hydraulic ramp trailers, and a zero‑scratch guarantee backed by 7‑layer foam wrapping. Coupled with 100% insurance coverage and live tracking, we deliver unmatched safety and reliability for bike owners.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are needed to ship a bike from Chennai to Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original bike registration certificate (RC), a valid insurance policy copy, a government‑issued ID proof, and a signed e‑Way bill. Our logistics team prepares the paperwork, ensures GST compliance, and submits all documents for smooth customs and railway clearance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect my bike from scratches and dents?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, and a stretch film weather‑proof layer. Custom wooden crates secure fragile parts, while the final layer adds extra cushioning, guaranteeing a scratch‑free arrival.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I expect any hidden charges during the bike transport from Chennai to Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees are applied. Our transparent pricing includes fuel surcharge, distance‑based rates, full insurance premium, and any applicable GST. All charges are disclosed in the quote before booking, and we provide a detailed invoice for corporate or government reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is live tracking important for my bike shipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Live tracking offers real‑time visibility, enabling you to monitor the exact location of your bike, receive proactive alerts about delays, and verify safe handling at each checkpoint. This transparency builds trust and ensures that any issues are addressed immediately, safeguarding your two‑wheeler.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
